1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,913
Have you ever wondered

2
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:01,927
if you can open your iPhone

3
00:00:01,947 --> 00:00:03,260
with your mirror reflection?

4
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,498
When the phone is awake,

5
00:00:04,518 --> 00:00:05,470
these cameras fire

6
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:06,601
over thirty thousand dots

7
00:00:06,621 --> 00:00:07,645
straight onto the face,

8
00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:08,689
and the infrared camera

9
00:00:08,709 --> 00:00:09,950
picks up the pattern.

10
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:11,219
But here's the twist:

11
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:12,834
a mirror bounces that light

12
00:00:12,854 --> 00:00:14,769
straight back onto my face.

13
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:16,907
So what's the phone really reading?

14
00:00:16,927 --> 00:00:18,558
My nose bends the dots one way,

15
00:00:18,578 --> 00:00:19,539
my cheeks another,

16
00:00:19,559 --> 00:00:20,674
and from those bends,

17
00:00:20,694 --> 00:00:21,750
it maps my face.

18
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,385
That's why a flat photo fails.

19
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:24,496
Nothing bends.

20
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,377
It also grabs an infrared picture,

21
00:00:26,397 --> 00:00:27,250
then checks both

22
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:28,720
against the face I set up.

23
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,601
No match, it stays locked.

24
00:00:30,621 --> 00:00:32,314
A match unlocks it.

25
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,791
So, did it work?

26
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,091
It unlocked for me!

27
00:00:35,111 --> 00:00:35,598
Did yours?

28
00:00:35,618 --> 00:00:37,069
Tell me in the comments.

